{"ID":"20240118151136-htx8yor","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118151136-htx8yor","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151136-htx8yor\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151136-rm9nxwx\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122130147-ztdl0jz\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122130147-ztdl0jz\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:458,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:458\u0026#125;","title":"183酸浆","type":"doc","updated":"20240201100506"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151136-rm9nxwx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151136-rm9nxwx","updated":"20240122130130"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味酸，平，无毒。治热，烦满，定志，益气，利水道。产难，吞其实立产。生川泽及人家田园中，一名醋浆。又名洛神珠。灯笼草。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122130134-6g9zszs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122130134-6g9zszs"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】田园之中。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122130136-u2u1aqq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122130136-u2u1aqq"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】其根及苗味苦，性寒。酸浆果味酸，性平。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122130137-8p0nkbt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122130137-8p0nkbt"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】其苗，叶，根，茎皆为解热，排水药，治百日咳，黄疸，小便赤涩，果能催生。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122130139-3evjjjs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122130139-3evjjjs"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【别录】酸浆果主治烦热，定志益气，利水道，难产吞之，立产。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122130141-ew3mz69","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122130141-ew3mz69"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【弘景】酸浆捣汁服，治黄病多效。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122130142-hzcyvnq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122130142-hzcyvnq"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【唐本】灯笼草治上气咳嗽，风热，明目，根茎花实并用。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122130144-e0810ad","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122130144-e0810ad"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【苏颂】酸浆果食之除热，治黄疸，尤宜小儿。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122130145-m0vmfb7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122130145-m0vmfb7"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】一般一钱至四钱。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122130146-1dmxxzr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122130146-1dmxxzr"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】孕妇禁忌。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122130130-pwiip8d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122130130-pwiip8d"}},{"ID":"20240122130147-mysfoo9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122130147-mysfoo9"}},{"ID":"20240122130147-w58h1v6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122130147-w58h1v6"}},{"ID":"20240122130147-ztdl0jz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122130147-ztdl0jz","updated":"20240201100506"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第一百八十三，那我们这里没有一百八十三这个药，这个为什么呢，因为一百八十三根据我的想法和考证，就是你们吃的洛神，什么洛神茶，酸酸的那个洛神果，就是它。到处田园之中都有。别名又叫洛神珠，也叫做灯笼草，圆圆的一颗。很甜，你们喝的洛神茶酸酸的，好像酸梅一样，很好吃的。如果一个法医说吃洛神茶死掉了，这个法医应该被开除，执照被吊销——蠢嘛。这种本身味酸的东西，都是有收敛的效果。你看看它的性味，它的根、它的苗是味苦性寒。酸浆果味酸，性平。酸味的东西呢，它能够治烦热，定志益气，平常你可以当茶来喝，很好。主要的呢，我们平常使用的时候，都是，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"比如说心情烦躁，夏天，你心情烦躁，口渴，都可以吃这个洛神，酸浆酸浆果，洛神来泡茶。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个药呢，一般我们除了汤剂里面放以外，泡茶都可以。你如果有自己中医诊所，那你在台湾，病人来等，你很忙嘛，煮一点菊花，杭菊。煮菊花茶放点洛神，酸酸甜甜的噢，甘草在里面，这个远志，一点点远志，因为这个比较苦嘛，病人在那边等就很开心，不会烦躁……等那么久还不来。很开心，所以可以煮点茶给他吃，洛神吃了很宁心静气。然后那个病人以后就会产生疑问，为什么每次到你的诊所来心情都很好，就是这个，一直在吃。当然你可以加点蔗糖，放点蔗糖下去更好。"}]}]}